WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.842
Hi! After reading a short text, questions ask who, what and where. Where are the answers? Today we'll learn to find them.

2
00:00:10.992 --> 00:00:13.578
First read the text slowly.

3
00:00:13.728 --> 00:00:16.530
Who asks about a person: Sam.

4
00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:19.938
What asks about a thing: a red kite.

5
00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:24.306
Where asks about a place: in the park.

6
00:00:24.456 --> 00:00:27.930
Circle the key word in the question, like kite.

7
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.986
Find the word in the text; the answer is nearby.

8
00:00:32.136 --> 00:00:35.754
Who is he? We met him before: Sam.

9
00:00:35.904 --> 00:00:40.722
The answer must come from the text, not a guess.

10
00:00:40.872 --> 00:00:43.794
Watch out! Don't guess!

11
00:00:43.944 --> 00:00:47.250
Find kite in the text: a red kite.

12
00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:50.922
So the answer is red.

13
00:00:51.072 --> 00:01:01.098
Your turn! Mei has a cat. It is white. Who has a cat? Pause and think.

14
00:01:01.248 --> 00:01:06.714
Who asks about a person: Mei. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:06.864 --> 00:01:14.754
Another one! What colour is the cat? Pause and think.

16
00:01:14.904 --> 00:01:20.274
It is white, and it is the cat. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:20.424 --> 00:01:27.978
Here's another! Where does Ben eat? Pause and think.

18
00:01:28.128 --> 00:01:33.858
Where asks about a place: in the kitchen. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:34.008 --> 00:01:41.586
Try one more! What does Ben eat? Pause and think.

20
00:01:41.736 --> 00:01:47.370
What asks about a thing: an apple. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:47.520 --> 00:01:54.858
Try one more! Who are they? Pause and think.

22
00:01:55.008 --> 00:02:00.066
They means Ali and Tom. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:00.216 --> 00:02:09.810
Try one more! The bus is big and yellow. Is the bus small? Pause and think.

24
00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:15.306
The text says big, so no. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:15.456 --> 00:02:23.154
Try one more! When does Dad read? Pause and think.

26
00:02:23.304 --> 00:02:28.698
When asks about time: at night. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:38.586
Try one more! Sam has a red kite. What colour is the kite? Pause and think.

28
00:02:38.736 --> 00:02:44.369
The text says a red kite: red. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:44.519 --> 00:02:53.754
Last one! Sam has a red kite. Who has a kite? Pause and think.

30
00:02:53.904 --> 00:02:59.345
Who asks about a person: Sam. Did you get it right?

31
00:02:59.495 --> 00:03:07.889
Remember: read the text first, check whether it asks who, what, where or when, and look back to find the answer.

32
00:03:08.039 --> 00:03:12.905
Read a little book and ask your family a who question!

